2026-07-27T11:28:46.8833422Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:28:46.8833875Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:28:46.8834892Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:28:46.8836765Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:28:46.8837605Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
